    "body": "<p>The Klaviyo Showcase service has been deprecated and is no longer available for use.      </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HT3C2JNKDC11YKPCQVGSX35V\">Alternative resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Want to know more about creating emails in Klaviyo? Check out this<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005082447\"> guide to the template editor</a>.</li>\n<li>Take this <a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/writing-sms-and-mms-copy\">course on writing SMS and MMS copy</a>.</li>\n<li>Read these articles to improve your <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/1260806260849\">SMS</a> or <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005247008\">email deliverability</a>. </li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
